What is the BBBBS "Friends" List???

"Friends" is a nifty feature added to BBBBS for users to assign aliases
to other email users.  Through the Alias Editor you can add, delete, or
view the aliases.  Once added, all you have to do is type the users
alias at the main menu prompt and hit enter, you will then be dropped
into the editor, ready to write an email message to that person. This
would otherwise require entering 'E' [Email], 'W' [Write], and then
the recipient's name. For example, I only have to type "Matt" at the main
menu, enter a subject, and start typing my email message to Matt English.
If you use bbsQUICK, you may use your Friendslist Aliases there, too.

Friends List feature by 
